<title>Evolution of the Internet</title>
<style>
body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#eaf8ff;color:#234158;margin:0;padding:24px}
header{text-align:center;background:#167b9d;color:white;padding:30px;border-radius:18px}
main{max-width:800px;margin:28px auto;border-left:4px solid #43a8c7;padding-left:22px}
.event{background:white;padding:20px;margin:20px 0;border-radius:13px;position:relative}
.event:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-33px;top:25px;width:16px;height:16px;background:#167b9d;border-radius:50%}
.year{color:#167b9d;font-weight:bold}
h2{margin-bottom:8px}
